## Workflow rules (company-level)
- ALL work on feature branches, NEVER directly to main/master
- Atomic commits: `git commit -m "..." -- path/to/file1 path/to/file2` (explicit paths only)
- Conventional Commits: feat|fix|refactor|chore|docs|test
- NEVER push without my explicit ask
- NEVER `git reset --hard`, `git restore`, `rm -rf` without my written approval
- `.env`, secrets: read-only, never modify

## Code review
- Run tests before opening MR/PR
- Self-review the diff before requesting human review
- For destructive changes: ask before, not after

